<a class="skip-link screen-reader-text" href="#content">Skip to content</a><?php include __DIR__ . '/../includes/header-8ffa8870.php'; ?><div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="82" class="elementor elementor-82" data-elementor-post-type="page"><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-fb0e7b5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="fb0e7b5" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6ac8400" data-id="6ac8400" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-99d44d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="99d44d5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h1>Our Story</h1></div></div></div></div></section><section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-73c30a5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="73c30a5" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section"><div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-980bae0" data-id="980bae0" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a31022f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a31022f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><p><strong>Imagine a beautiful aquarium but without fish.</strong></p><p>That was the inspiration for our creating the first <a href="/indoor-water-fountains/">indoor waterfall</a> and <a href="/bubble-walls/">bubble wall</a>. And in many ways, the invention grew out of necessity.</p><p>Founded in 1977, our business grew out of servicing custom fish tanks in doctors’ offices.</p><p>The problem: while the doctors appreciated the visual-interest and relaxing effects the tanks brought to their offices, they didn’t appreciate the maintenance required to keep the aquarium clean and stocked with healthy fish.</p><p>So, we redesigned the water features to keep the aspects they liked while removing the labor they didn’t.</p><p>The result: we pioneered water walls, bubble walls, bubble tubes, rain curtains, <a href="/indoor-water-fountains/">water fountains</a>, water-based trade show displays, reflection pools, fountains and other, mostly water features.</p><p>Our installations make people stop, look, think, and relax as well as help them feel more relaxed, successful, and optimistic. It’s a proven fact. Today, Midwest Tropical remains a family-owned business and continues to evolve in product offerings and designs. We specialize in designing and fabricating beautiful indoor water features for many industries including hospitality and healthcare.</p><p>Our team of craftsman and designers is highly experienced working with stainless steel, copper, and other metals as well as acrylic, glass, stone, tile, slate, granite, and other materials.</p><p>We create our indoor waterfalls, water walls, bubble walls, fountains, rain curtains, and other water features in our advanced design and manufacturing facility near Chicago, Illinois &#8211;allowing for complete customization in order to design and build the <a href="/water-features/">highest quality water features</a> in the world.</p><p>Our water features are found in both large and small businesses as well as in hotels, resorts, healthcare facilities, spas, restaurants, casinos, offices and private residences around the world.</p><p><a href="/contact-us-2/">Contact us</a> today to get started on your project.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class="mtx-related" aria-labelledby="mtx-related-title"><div class="mtx-related__inner"><div class="mtx-related__head"><h2 id="mtx-related-title">Explore more custom water features</h2><p>Popular feature types and recent articles.</p></div><ul class="mtx-related__grid"><li><a href="/bubble-walls/"><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Water feature type</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Bubble Walls</span></a></li><li><a href="/water-walls/"><span class="mtx-related__img"><img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/uploads/water_walls_in_hotel_lobby_godfrey_hotel_chicago_scored_black_acrylic_waterfalls-2-768x511.jpg" alt="" width="480" height="320"></span><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Water feature type</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Water Walls</span></a></li><li><a href="/rain-curtains/"><span class="mtx-related__img"><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" src="/wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-300x1631-jpg.avif" alt="" width="480" height="320"></span><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Water feature type</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Rain Curtains</span></a></li><li><a href="/specialty-fountains/"><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Water feature type</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Custom Fountains</span></a></li><li><a href="/swirly-or-vertical-chamber-choosing-a-bubble-wall-style-for-your-space/"><span class="mtx-related__img"><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-or-Vertical-Chamber-Choosing-a-Bubble-Wall-Style-for-Your-Space-768x512.png.webp" type="image/webp"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-or-Vertical-Chamber-Choosing-a-Bubble-Wall-Style-for-Your-Space-768x512.png" alt="" width="480" height="320"></picture></span><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Article</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Swirly or Vertical Chamber? Choosing a Bubble Wall Style for Your Space</span></a></li><li><a href="/swirly-bubble-walls-and-the-art-of-movement-in-interior-design/"><span class="mtx-related__img"><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-Bubble-Walls-and-the-Art-of-Movement-in-Interior-Design-1-1-768x512.png.webp" type="image/webp"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-Bubble-Walls-and-the-Art-of-Movement-in-Interior-Design-1-1-768x512.png" alt="" width="480" height="320"></picture></span><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Article</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Swirly Bubble Walls and the Art of Movement in Interior Design</span></a></li></ul><div class="mtx-related__cta"><p><strong>Planning a water feature?</strong> Free design consultation and price estimate — since 1977, made in Skokie, Illinois, installed nationwide.</p><a class="mtx-btn" href="/request-a-quote/">Request a free consultation</a><a class="mtx-btn mtx-btn--ghost" href="tel:+18883652393">Call 888-365-2393</a></div></div></section><?php include __DIR__ . '/../includes/footer-c2c168b1.php'; ?>
